sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Main as Application Root
    participant SL as java.util.ServiceLoader
    participant SPI as StorageProvider (Interface)
    participant Impl as FileSystemProvider (Concrete)
    participant Svc as StorageService (Instance)

    Note over Main, Svc: Fase di Bootstrap (Wiring)

    Main->>SL: load(StorageProvider.class)
    SL->>SL: Scan META-INF/services/
    SL-->>Main: Iterator<StorageProvider>

    Main->>SPI: create(Config) (Polimorfismo)

    Note right of Main: Main non conosce "FileSystemProvider",<br/>vede solo l'interfaccia SPI.

    SPI->>Impl: new FileSystemStorageStrategy(...)
    Impl-->>Main: StorageService (Ready to use)

    Main->>Main: Inject into TaxReportService